<%- include('partials/header') %><div class="hero"><div class="hero-content"><div class="hero-badge"><span class="dot"></span><span>Self-hosted &middot; Open source &middot; Early stage</span></div><h1>A small Git host<br>you <span class="gradient-text">run yourself</span></h1><p class="hero-subtitle">Scavvers is a small, self-hosted, open-source Git platform (MIT, &copy; 2026 Scavvers Labs). It runs on Node.js, Express, and SQLite, stores bare repositories on disk, and uses ordinary git clone and git push over HTTP. The project is at an early stage.</p><% if (!currentUser) { %><div class="hero-actions"><a href="/register" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Create an account &rarr;</a><a href="/login" class="btn btn-outline btn-lg">Sign in</a></div><% } else { %><div class="hero-actions"><a href="/new" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Create a repository</a><a href="/@<%= currentUser.username %>" class="btn btn-outline btn-lg">My repos</a></div><% } %></div></div><div class="container"><div class="section"><h2 class="section-title">📦 Public Repositories</h2><% if (repos.length === 0) { %><div style="text-align:center;padding:60px;color:var(--text-secondary);"><p>No public repositories yet. Be the first!</p></div><% } else { %><div class="repo-list"><% repos.forEach(function(repo) { %><div class="repo-card"><div class="repo-card-header"><a href="/<%= repo.full_name %>" class="repo-name"><span class="repo-owner"><%= repo.owner_name %></span><span class="repo-separator">/</span><span class="repo-project"><%= repo.name %></span></a><% if (repo.private) { %><span class="badge badge-private">Private</span><% } else { %><span class="badge badge-public">Public</span><% } %></div><% if (repo.description) { %><p class="repo-description"><%= repo.description %></p><% } %><div class="repo-meta"><span> Updated <%= moment(repo.updated_at).fromNow() %></span></div></div><% }); %></div><% } %></div><div class="features-section"><h2 class="section-title">What Scavvers does today</h2><div class="features-grid"><div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon">🏠</div><h3>Self-hosted</h3><p>You run Scavvers on your own server. Repositories are ordinary bare Git repositories on disk.</p></div><div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon">🔒</div><h3>Public by default</h3><p>New repositories are public. A private repository is visible to its owner only. There are no collaborators.</p></div><div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon"></div><h3>Small stack</h3><p>The app is Node.js and Express. Users and repository metadata live in SQLite.</p></div><div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon">🆓</div><h3>MIT license</h3><p>Open source under the MIT license. Copyright &copy; 2026 Scavvers Labs.</p></div></div></div></div><%- include('partials/footer') %>
